description=Fixes the skill tooltip in the character info menu. Without this mod, hovering a skill shows the raw key text (for example "IGUI_perks_Carpinteria_Description") in every language but English. The mod looks the key up correctly, so the description the game already ships translated is used. Works in all 28 game languages with a single file.
